    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kijaunae ŋituŋa ŋulu eyakuunio alo Babilon",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋirwa ŋul, kiira erwosit a Babilon ŋolo anyaritae Merodak-baladan ŋolo arae lokoku a Baladan atemar kedyaka erwosit Esekia ka aŋaleu. Aŋun, abu iŋes kiyaki ŋituŋa inasi Esekia ŋabaruwae ka ainakinet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Esekia kijau ŋipeyok ŋul, kitoodik ikes akai keŋ ŋina a ebari keŋ, kitoodik ikes esilipa, egolid, ŋikito ŋulu akukunyok, akimyet ŋina epol egyelit, ŋiboro ŋulu ke ejie daadaŋ, ŋiboro daadaŋ ŋulu eŋadatae nakais ŋuna iŋadao ŋiboro. Mam ibore alokai keŋ, kori anakwap a ŋina epukat iŋes a daadaŋ ŋini abu Esekia nyitoodik ŋipeyok ŋul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bu nai ekadwaran Isaya neni a erwosit Esekia, kiŋit tema, “Ŋakiro a nu irworosi ŋituŋa ŋul? Ai aponiata ikes neni kon?” Toboŋok Esekia tema, “Eponito ikes neni kaŋ anakwap a ŋina alwanan nooi, a ŋina enyaritae Babilon.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiŋit Isaya erwosit tema, “Inyoni eŋolikis ikes alokai kon?” Toboŋok Esekia tema, “Eŋolikis ikes ibore daadaŋ alokai kaŋ, mam ibore anakais a ŋuna eŋadat ayoŋ ŋiboro ŋini nyitoodikina ayoŋ ikes.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
